  (text "KEY MATRIX: columns D4-D9 driven low one at a time, rows D1-D3 read with pull-ups (see scanButtonMatrix). Diode anode to switch, cathode to column." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 198.12 7.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dbebe127-3cdb-433c-bec9-cc4f66596c57"))
  (text "C4 is a direct key on D10 to GND (firmware uses internal pull-up).  BTN1-6 = top-row buttons on the 6 unused matrix slots (NOTE_MAPPING -1 entries)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 198.12 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "db9189fd-a616-46cc-80e3-83ca5804f187"))
  (text "POTS: panel-mount 10k linear pots wired to 3-pin headers: 1 = +3V3A, 2 = wiper -> A0..A4, 3 = AGND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 198.12 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "686d07b2-d182-4480-851b-f4ae69377cc3"))
  (text "POWER: USB-C only. VBUS -> 2A polyfuse -> panel switch (J3) -> +5V rail for Seed VIN and the amp. 5.1k CC pull-downs advertise a 1.5A sink." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 223.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "48db345b-c050-440e-98f4-49eb31c3a805"))
  (text "USB-C data to D29/D30 = Daisy 'external' USB. In firmware use MidiUsbTransport::Config::EXTERNAL." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f770cab0-7d3a-4f03-903b-6f25ccdc4340"))
  (text "AMP: Adafruit #987 breakout on a 1x9 header, single-ended inputs (L-/R- to GND). Speaker outputs come back via J4 -> ferrite + 220p EMI filter -> JST-PH." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 304.8 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "25bd1fd7-05f4-4f50-a866-7421532da9d5"))
  (text "Outputs are bridge-tied: NO series caps on the speakers, never join L- and R-." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 304.8 233.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8c6f4588-6fdd-4f40-9a36-04dce9b85ee8"))
  (text "HEADPHONES: TPA6138A2 (gain -1, ground-centred output, no output caps) drives the jack. TN contact = plug detect (HP_DET). Q1 pulls the speaker amp SD low when plugged. D11 = speaker mute, D13 reads HP_DET, D14 = headphone mute (pulled up)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 299.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "236ad4ad-b1de-49b0-bc12-85759255e1a0"))
  (text "EXPANSION: spare Seed GPIO/ADC + 3V3/5V/GND for a future display, encoder, MIDI DIN, etc." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 508 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e5f0bbbe-6827-4e7d-b826-66ea347bf8c0"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
